+/******************************* VIR SHADER BINARY FILE VERSION ******************/
+/* current version */
+/* 0.0.1.4 add chipModel and ChipRevision, Nov. 30, 2017 */
+/* 0.0.1.6 add VIR_OP_CLAMPCOORD, Feb. 2, 2018 */
+/* 0.0.1.7 remove VG from shader flags, Mar. 1, 2018 */
